{"about_the_game":"<strong>CARDIAN</strong> is a deckbuilding dungeon crawler with fast-paced card battles, set in a colorful tabletop world of reflective animals.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/test012345.gif?t=1720110277\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A card-combining battle system inspired by the old-school ATB (Active Time Battle) JRPG combat and physical card games such as Star Realms.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/test0123457.gif?t=1720110277\" /><br><br></li><li>Three varied regions to master, each with their own enemies, cards and trinkets to find!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/test012.gif?t=1720110277\" /><br><br></li><li>Beautiful card artwork filled with colorful animals.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/test0123.gif?t=1720110277\" /><br><br></li><li>Pocket-sized adventure with a playtime of around 2 hours.</li></ul></strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968070?t=1720110277","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1720110277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1720110277","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1720110277","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3002200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>CARDIAN</strong> is a deckbuilding dungeon crawler with fast-paced card battles, s